  m_text: 'Yo! I just wanted to slide some quick tips since you''re new here.


    The
    admin code to the digital lock for the filing system should be 0545. The old
    geezer who had it before would always forget it otherwise.


    Also, don''t
    take too much time on break. The company might say you have a lot, but if you
    use it all they''ll start pressing you.


    // Friendly Neighbourhood Co-worker'
